{"time": 1768985447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263541820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”如果，有一个人偷窃了一个和玛雅预言，世界末日有关的东西，最后来到了阿卡姆。他可能的目的会是什么呢？“"}
{"time": 1768985617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455622932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“如果是这样，我猜要么是途经点用来掩人耳目，要么就在阿卡姆酝酿一个大阴谋了”"}
{"time": 1768985679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895520734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“哇，那好邪恶”"}
