{"time": 1768985900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261644508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=546174814]（厉害）"}
{"time": 1768985957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028585588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=337925183]“没错，不过目前的进度……不容乐观，请您见笑了”"}
{"time": 1768986027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157528187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”另外，图书馆地下室的馆长委托我们寻回丢失的藏书。在12月14日，我看见教授曾进入过地下藏书室。您有拿取过那里的图书吗？“"}
{"time": 1768986068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074627202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我对星尘确实有所研究，随我来吧”说着，他慢慢走出教室"}
{"time": 1768986087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669059346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2074627202]“好的”"}
{"time": 1768986135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673760496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157528187]“没有，我和阿米蒂奇馆长讨论过星尘，她似乎并没什么兴趣”"}
{"time": 1768986159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745883683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“嗯”"}
{"time": 1768986220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916327182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#如果查尔斯教授没有说谎的话，那么窃贼只能是穿着皮衣的中年了"}
{"time": 1768986338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995348024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "你们随着查尔斯教授来到一楼到办公室"}
{"time": 1768986422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392486965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#看看办公室"}
{"time": 1768986482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745828303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "这个办公室十分简洁。一个巨大的书架摆在墙边，上面是各种书籍，旁边是一个办公桌和老式电脑，桌子上堆满了各式各样的文件。而就在门口，是一个大沙发和饮水机，还放了几棵绿植点缀。"}
{"time": 1768986529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733422698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#很标准的办公室"}
{"time": 1768986572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048537807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“那么，Professor，您对星尘有什么发现呢？”"}
{"time": 1768986631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68897797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（网好像有点问题）"}
{"time": 1768986664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371598748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们要问星尘的话，确实是问对人了。”他走到书架上，从一侧拿出一个尘封的小盒子，轻吹灰尘。随即，在小盒子中拿出一页日记"}
{"time": 1768986668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526983036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=FFC1161DAFAA1846D28B3E0AA950BB55.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSIPdObqAzIZuVb_YsBs-eFmd744hjarxIg_wooj9K376SckgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9uNIVIXS1kB95n1Bl6c9RHoCz4-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMPmGhF0fJWqAsZ0cs6h3h3QJ0zAHUemMXfz2L-69_zRdrKqCCT15bJgCJJ7wcSQsaw,file_size=301018]"}
{"time": 1768986691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363725986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=68897797]（在赶火车？）"}
{"time": 1768986695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063226482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（没）"}
{"time": 1768986788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159749960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "”这是我一个家族的长辈写下的笔记，这里面就提到了星尘“"}
{"time": 1768986825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468248002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“这是……”"}
{"time": 1768986917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797377751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“星尘似乎是一种时空旅行装置，但他患有失忆症，这个日记就是在他失忆的时候写下来的，所以更多的细节我也不知道”"}
{"time": 1768986987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735390866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“听说这个星尘就在伦敦，我还打算过两个月闲下来去看看，没想到已经不见了。”"}
{"time": 1768986991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029306040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“令人难以置信”"}
{"time": 1768987357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994689175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1029306040]“我也认为，为此我也展开过研究，但收获甚少”"}
{"time": 1768987521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826019923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“不过，教授也不会平白无故向我们分享如此重要的研究吧，是有什么诉求吗？”"}
{"time": 1768987797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661749265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“哈哈”他笑了笑，“分享知识是什么可耻的事情吗。而且这种如此特殊的物质，要是就此遗忘就可惜了”"}
{"time": 1768987928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251053591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“抱歉，是我肤浅了”"}
{"time": 1768987966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068341953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”哈哈“"}
